<p:sld xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main"><p:cSld><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{340B6FAF-3C17-231C-6E00-B028AC45CF4D}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="0" cy="0"/><a:chOff x="0" y="0"/><a:chExt cx="0" cy="0"/></a:xfrm></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="4" name="Title 3"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{C702349B-72BB-6136-2201-6297581B94AF}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="title"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>INSTALLING A SIGA-CRH</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="2" name="Content Placeholder 4"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{06AFFA00-9381-62BD-61E4-8F465782C6C9}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph sz="half" idx="1"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="1447330" y="2010878"/><a:ext cx="9605635" cy="4847122"/></a:xfrm></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr><a:normAutofit fontScale="62500" lnSpcReduction="20000"/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="457200" indent="-457200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="170000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Write the address assigned to the module on the label provided, and then apply the label to the module. Remove the serial number label from the module, and then attach it to the project documentation. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="457200" indent="-457200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="170000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Verify that all field wiring is free of opens, shorts, and ground faults. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="457200" indent="-457200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="170000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Strip 1/4 in. (about 6 mm) from the ends of all wires that connect to the terminal block of the module. When stripping wire ends, exposing more wire may cause a ground fault; exposing less wire may result in a faulty connection. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="457200" indent="-457200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="170000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Use a slotted screwdriver to release the latches on the hinged terminal cover, and then swing the cover up to access the relay terminals. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="457200" indent="-457200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="170000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Make the wiring connections as shown in Figure 1. Use separate knockouts for the SLC wiring and the high voltage wiring. Make sure that power-limited and nonpower-limited wires will have a minimum of 0.25 in. (6.4 mm) separation when fitted into the box. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="457200" indent="-457200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="170000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Swing the terminal cover down and snap it back into place, one latch at a time. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="457200" indent="-457200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="170000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Attach the module to the electrical box, using the screws provided with the box. See Figure 2. See “Specifications” for a list of compatible boxes. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="457200" indent="-457200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="170000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Attach the wall plate to the module, using the two self-tapping screws provided.</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree><p:extLst><p:ext uri="{BB962C8B-B14F-4D97-AF65-F5344CB8AC3E}"><p14:creationId xmlns:p14="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/powerpoint/2010/main" val="2417241529"/></p:ext></p:extLst></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>